<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Bryan Fury Socker Kick (Left Side) QCB+3

This macro is designed to perform combos in a game called Tekken 7 and Tekken 8 with a single button.

To do this technique, you need to be to the left.

Movements are W,A ,S ,D
Key mapping;  1=J  2=I 3=K  4=L

The macro has been tested in numerous online battles. Problems can only be due to your unstable Internet connection with the enemy, as well as this macro works only at a stable frame rate of 59-60 fps.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 22 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 4 1
KeyDown 14 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 14 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
